                                "sense_id": "75df2da2-0adc-3cc1-9dcd-7ba9f709ce6b",
                                "text": "\"That's what I call judgmatical,\" old Mike shouted, with a voice that rivalled cannon; \"whoever thought of that deserves three epulets, one on each shoulder and one upon his head."
